LAN
---

**LAN (RJ45) connector** provides Ethernet connectivity over standardized Ethernet cable. The integrated Ethernet interface supports up to 1 Gbps data throughput.

.. rst-class:: text-center

  |lan_img|

  *RJ45 LAN Connector*


.. note::

   Use CAT5e or better cables to achieve full data throughput over the maximum distance defined by the 1000BASE-T standard (100 m).

